# Accessibility

- Ensure interactive elements are semantic (`button`, `a`, form controls) and keyboard accessible.
- Add and maintain appropriate ARIA labels/attributes when semantics alone are not enough.
- Preserve visible focus states and keyboard navigation behavior.
- Ensure dialogs/menus/sheets support close via expected interactions (e.g., Escape or close controls).
- Keep color contrast and readable typography in mind when applying styles.
- Treat accessibility regressions as bugs and fix them during implementation.
